WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.300
To our viewers all over Japan,
it's a very beautiful day today!

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.440
How nice that we have a
comfortable season like this!

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.280
There was a power line accident
in Tokyo, causing some trouble.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.410
But it doesn't affect us at all, so
you don't need to worry about...

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.880
Boomers all over Tokyo have
gone out of control!

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.290
This symptom is transmittable! Be careful!

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.850
It's not just the power lines.
Boomers are not just robots...

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.280
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.250
People who are still in Tokyo,
hurry and evacuate!

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.340
Genom is...

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.630
The phenomenon has been
expanding with incredible speed!

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.510
Magnificent!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:35.290
What the late Dr. Stingray created

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:38.050
was not simply a robot which
imitates a human being.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.830
What the late Dr. Stingray intended to create

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.350
was a living metal, forged with intelligence.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.540
The false organism known as a boomer,

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:55.770
whose seed was implanted in the
hypothalamus of his daughter,

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:00.740
took electrical properties from the
nerve cells of the human brain,

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.440
and created an antibody, thereby
completing its own program.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.590
What is it?!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.560
Don't scare me like that, Fox!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.500
What are you going to do?

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.430
I don't have a choice, but to go
back to my hometown.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.700
If I stay in a place like this, I'll
wind up being killed by boomers.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.840
I never imagined the group would break up the
group over something like this.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.700
We can't do anything about it.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.000
I wonder what Priss is doing?

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.820
She hasn't been back to her trailer.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.450
It can't be...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.580
She's not the kind of girl to get
killed by a boomer without a fight.

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.650
I guess not.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:52.750
The Sekiria World Tour is just a dream now.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.390
I can't get through at all.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:21.220
I wonder if she has enough of a brain to call us?

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:25.460
Don't say such mean things! I heard
Tokyo's situation is horrible!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.330
Why isn't the TV news talking
about Tokyo at all?!

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:36.370
Investors swarm to advanced technologies.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.980
The one that put its eyes on
the boomer was Genom.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.550
Chairman Rosenkroitz

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.650
commercialized boomers without
making human beings feel guilty.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.630
We needed to yoke boomers, with
their human-like qualities,

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.290
in order to make them obey humans.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.060
The yoke was the shape of the
boomer, a shape similar to man's.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:07.240
As long as boomers are humanoid,

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.640
the boomers' fate is decided.
A boomer must be a boomer.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:15.980
A boomer's logic doesn't mean
anything to a human to begin with,

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.920
but sometimes boomers go mad.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.120
It isn't officially reported to the public,

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:29.250
but the number of mad boomer
occurrences has risen rapidly.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:35.900
Genom invested large amounts of money
in the Japanese National Police,

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:39.630
and made them alter the AD Police
from an urban anti-terrorist force

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.070
into a special division for dealing
with boomer crimes.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.510
But the AD Police is gone now.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.800
I'm going to send the picture.

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:26.880
To direct solar energy to the Earth
by using a space umbrella,

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.290
Genom's Showhamm Project was created.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:33.190
It is certain that the Dragon Line,
which was constructed

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.660
for that project, is the cause
of the mad boomers.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.630
If we don't do something, not
only Tokyo, but all other...

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.930
Damn it! This time, they sent
scramble noise directly here.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.700
Nene, shall we change the circuit again?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:49.170
No, not necessary. Nobody will be watching this.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:53.270
Both of you did a good job. We did
whatever we can do for now.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:54.600
Nene...

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.280
Thank you for your support.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:05.190
Oh, no. I'm an employee of the AD Police.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.720
An employee! Well, I guess that's close enough.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:14.730
I'd never thought how humiliating it is for us

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:18.000
that someone controls the media like this.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.810
What are you going to do now?

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:26.140
You? You mean the Knight Sabers?

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:28.810
Unofficial troops combating mad boomers...

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:32.380
Under such circumstances, you
can't deal with them, right?

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.320
We don't put on hard suits anymore, so...

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:43.020
Incoming mail? The code is for
an AD Police front officer.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.460
I have it too.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:51.070
Leon, front officers are still in Tokyo!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.000
They're all waiting for instructions.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.740
What shall we do now, Leon?

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:00.880
We'll use the remaining weapons
to seal the Dragon Line.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.610
But you said the remaining weapons...

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.100
The anti-boomer electromagnetic
gun is out of the question,

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:09.780
but I'm sure we can use the
grenades from branch personnel!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:15.190
What part should we destroy in
order to close the Dragon Line?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.590
The Nerima area maybe.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:22.030
If they connect the lifeline north of Nerima,

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.970
the northeast part of Japan will be out.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.000
All right!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.940
Gather all our employees!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:27.900
Right!

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:11.570
If you want to get out of here,
you may leave, Meisio.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.090
I want to stay here.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:19.580
I wish to complete my life by
serving you, Lady Sylia.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:27.220
Why don't you take a swim, Priss?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.830
I don't feel like it.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:34.460
Why did you come here? I thought
you would never fight again.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.840
Is this place safe?

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.110
This building is fine unless it
takes a direct nuclear hit.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.910
I'd thought the hard suits could be improved.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.160
I guess you already know,

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:59.260
but the hard suit is a type of
boomer whose core is controlled.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:03.170
By joining with the body of the
wearer, it can function perfectly.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.400
It can also control the self-consciousness
of the boomer.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.570
I thought you were the one who
hated boomers the most, Sylia.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:14.670
Sure, but I'm also the person most
intimate with boomers.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:20.650
Because Galatea and Mackey were
both born inside my brain.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:25.960
As long as we used the purest
core left at my father's laboratory,

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.790
the hard suits wouldn't go out of
control anymore, I thought.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.830
But they did.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:43.040
Yes. There are no boomers that
won't go out of control, period.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.180
By changing its shape, a boomer
can own a self-consciousness

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:49.680
that has a totally different logic
from that of a human being.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:54.080
I finally understand a real boomer
is a boomer that changes shape.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:58.710
Therefore, I can't forgive myself if I
don't exploit this feature aggressively.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.920
What do you mean?

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:04.950
You'll understand if you see what I
asked Nigel and Mackey to make.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.930
There's still a possibility it might
go out of control, isn't there?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:14.040
If we let them do that or not, depends
on our strength of mind.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.570
I don't like psychiatric logic like that.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.940
I thought you'd say that.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.540
I guess I didn't explain it very well.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:24.710
Well, to put it your way, you can...

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.290
What's wrong?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.180
Galatea...

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.030
Sylia! Sylia!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.730
Meisio!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:05.780
Your phenomenon is spreading
all over Japan and the world

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.650
through the underground Dragon Line.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.160
Galatea, do you want to make
human beings into your slaves?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:18.230
I wonder if it would be interesting to do so?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.260
I don't understand at all.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:25.740
Even I, a human being, have
predicted that your purpose

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.650
isn't so petty as to take revenge
on human beings.

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:31.510
I have many things which
I still don't understand.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.620
Why did you try to release
our self-consciousness

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.750
even though you're a human being,

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.850
and even though you had to do so
many unreasonable things?

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.390
Because I am not a perfect human.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.570
Does that mean you had to
replace many of your organs

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:55.530
with artificial things, because you
got sick when you were a child?

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:58.440
The chairman and I are complete opposites.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.410
He hated to implant something
unnatural into his body,

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.350
and connected himself to the hoses.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:05.210
Then, he lived in a disgusting
fashion for a long time.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.720
Even so, you can't be anything
but a human being.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:13.660
Humans can no longer evolve, making this the
downfall of living organisms.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:18.830
It's so easy to predict the end of
humanity, or the end of the Earth.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.320
This is certain, leaving no room
for anything, not even chaos.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.000
Therefore, this complicated future,

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.270
brought by a living thing like you,
different from human beings,

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:31.140
I want to see it with my own eyes.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:36.310
The boomer inside your body was
made in an early stage,

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:39.480
and it blended into your human organs.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.380
That's why it won't wake up.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.520
I...

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:46.180
I am neither a human being, nor a boomer!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.980
I'm an observer!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.130
The water storage well located
underground here at Loop 8

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.830
is right on the Dragon Line.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:03.070
If we destroy this well, we'll be
able to cut its connection

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.110
to the lifeline that winds around
areas to the north.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.100
I see.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.940
I wonder if everybody is coming or not?

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:12.980
It's a man's world! There's no way
they wouldn't show up.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:16.280
I don't think that has anything to do
with it, especially in this situation.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.050
What?

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.110
Is that...

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:31.830
Nick, I only called front officers,
or former front officers.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.200
I sure am a former front officer.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:41.280
You're right, but in your case, you
retired because of your age.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.410
Chief!

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:47.420
Nene Romanova, you're the one
not suitable for this mission.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:51.190
This is not the kind of work that
uses your incredible intelligence.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:54.160
Once I'm in a hard suit,

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.060
even if there are hundreds of boomers,

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:00.100
I'll yell and rat-a-tat-tat, and
shoot every one of them,

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.400
and bash them, and put it together
and pull out the core and kaboom!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.400
Well, bye bye! That's it!

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.940
Hey, Leon, can you do something
about her way of talking?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.700
No, I can't. Get used to it.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:17.310
But just three of us to destroy the Dragon Line...

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.940
Not just you guys.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.300
Wow! It's everybody!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.630
They're all coming!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.000
Priss!

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.820
Are these boomers to make into hard suits?

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:28.420
How many suits can you make out of these?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.150
You're kidding me. It's only for one suit.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.190
No way...

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:37.460
The new hard suit will enhance its metal
formation through conscious control.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:40.020
So it's incredibly heavy.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.820
But don't worry, its power is also increased.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:49.310
Since you came here, that means
you'll put this on again, won't you?

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:51.340
I didn't say that.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:52.310
Priss!

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:00.050
How do I look?

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.650
This is incredible! It's a little
troublesome to put on,

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.760
but I can move a lot faster than before!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.160
I haven't tried it outside so I don't know really,

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.360
but the jumping power of this thing must be...

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.450
Seven times better.

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.860
I set its power five times more
than the previous one.

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.830
The biggest feature of this new suit is...

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.580
Well, you'll see with your own eyes.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.450
You're so stingy, Nigel!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:30.310
Sylia...

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:36.490
Sylia approved of our leaving the features
of a boomer in this new hard suit,

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.950
so it is possible.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:41.820
I wonder what it is...

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:46.560
What?! Don't be so stubborn!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.830
I'm not.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.170
Then what?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.360
I can see quite a bit of you.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.700
I didn't know my body was this exposed!

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:57.870
What are you looking at?!

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.100
Oh, no, I'm not...

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.670
Well, I wonder who it is?

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.920
Mackey, what shall I do?!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.750
Nene, what's wrong?!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.360
Cars remaining inside the tunnel

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.070
were gathered, and combined with the boomer!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:25.590
We can't stop it using our equipment!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.310
Daley, we're just wasting our
bullets at this distance.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.570
I guess so. What shall we do?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.180
Right!

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.870
We have no other choice, do we?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.150
Those idiots!

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.620
Leon! Daley!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.310
I don't believe they intend to
crash into it! Leon-pea!

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:48.860
I've been telling her not to call me that, little brat!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:52.400
I don't understand why you need
to be so serious, big brother.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.860
We have to do something before
the car combines with it! Let's go!

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:55.690
Roger.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.110
Leon! Daley!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.410
I wish I had my hard suit!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.280
What did you say?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:14.650
We don't have time to chat right now!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:21.460
Leon, don't you think it looks like
it's getting mad at something?

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:26.130
I don't care! I don't know if a
boomer can get mad or not.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.260
Listen, the core must be located
deep inside one of its eyes.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:33.070
No matter how big it gets, there
is a core in its spinal area.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:38.610
Good. Come close to us or we
can't destroy your armor.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:39.480
Not yet?

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:40.530
A little bit more.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.340
Oh, no! It's already started!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:48.220
Damn, this is it, Daley!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.490
A little bit more.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:50.990
Don't act so calm!

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.450
I said a little bit more.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.560
You said you were going back to
your hometown farm, didn't you?

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:58.790
I didn't like it, so I came here.

00:19:58.790 --> 00:19:59.620
Now!

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.210
Did we get it?

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.530
Oh, no way!

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.460
Damn...

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.440
What? Why?! The core is gone.

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:59.280
Next Episode

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.780
You all cheated! I envy all of you!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.700
I want to wear a suit like that too!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.290
Right! I'm going to ask Sylia to make one for me!

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.580
A custom made suit, just for me,
that nobody else can wear!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.080
It looks like metal, and feels cold when I wear it!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.210
Mad boomers will be gone in an instant!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.000
Tada! What is the answer?

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.090
The new type hard suit!

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:20.470
Well, I guess nobody's listening to me.

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.340
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
